// # emit-x86 const N-string concat
//
// Logline: Print the concat of three string literals so emit-x86 can lower a STRING plus chain.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. Not two-string-only.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Concat aa, bb, and cc.
//   3. Print the result.
//
// residual: mixed ident concat and calls stay later.

pub fn main() {
    println("aa" + "bb" + "cc");
}
